# Coding agents: local state, transcripts, caches, personal overrides.
# Shared agent config is deliberately NOT ignored and should be committed:
#   CLAUDE.md, AGENTS.md, GEMINI.md, .claude/settings.json,
#   .claude/{skills,agents,commands,rules,output-styles,workflows}/,
#   .mcp.json (secrets as ${VAR} only), .worktreeinclude, .cursor/rules/,
#   .github/copilot-instructions.md, .gemini/settings.json, .codex/config.toml,
#   .agents/{rules,workflows,skills,agents,plugins}/ (Antigravity & cross-agent),
#   and agent ignore files (.cursorignore, .geminiignore, .aiderignore, ...).
# .vscode/mcp.json is covered by the baseline .vscode/* rule; re-include it in
# the project section only after confirming it holds no literal tokens.

# Claude Code: personal settings, private instructions, local subagent memory, worktrees
**/.claude/settings.local.json
**/CLAUDE.local.md
**/.claude/agent-memory-local/
**/.claude/worktrees/

# Gemini CLI: project-scoped API keys, pasted-image scratch
**/.gemini/.env
.gemini-clipboard/

# Aider: chat/input/LLM history and repo-map cache
.aider.chat.history.md
.aider.input.history
.aider.llm.history
.aider.tags.cache.v*/

# OpenCode: plan-mode scratch files, plugin dependencies
**/.opencode/plans/
**/.opencode/node_modules/

# Crush: session database, logs, local state
.crush/

# SpecStory: auto-saved chat transcripts from Cursor, Copilot, Claude Code, Codex...
**/.specstory/history/
**/.specstory/ai_rules_backups/

# Serena: symbol cache
**/.serena/cache/

# Git worktrees created for parallel agent sessions
/.worktrees/
